on></span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-black/5 dark:border-white/5 bg-neutral-50/80 dark:bg-neutral-900/95 backdrop-blur-xl backdrop-saturate-150 px-5 py-4 pr-16 shadow-xs text-[13px] leading-6\" data-language=\"tsx\"><code class=\"font-mono text-foreground/90\">import { AuthForm } from &quot;@/components/ui/AuthForm&quot;;\n\n&lt;AuthForm\n  layout=&quot;split&quot;\n  method=&quot;password&quot;\n  brand={{ name: &quot;Fernwood&quot;, logo: &lt;YourLogo /&gt; }}\n  onSignIn={async ({ email, password }) =&gt; {\n    await signIn(&quot;credentials&quot;, { email, password });\n  }}\n  onSignUp={async ({ name, email, password }) =&gt; {\n    await createAccount({ name, email, password });\n  }}\n  onForgot={(email) =&gt; requestReset(email)}\n  onProvider={(id) =&gt; signIn(id)}\n/&gt;</code></pre></div></div></div></section><section id=\"use-cases\" class=\"scroll-mt-24\"><h2 class=\"mb-5 text-lg font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em]\">Use cases</h2><ul class=\"grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2\"><li class=\"rounded-lg border border-black/5 dark:border-white/5 bg-neutral-50/80 dark:bg-neutral-900/95 backdrop-blur-xl backdrop-saturate-150 p-4 shadow-xs\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium tracking-tight\">App sign-in page</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] leading-5 text-muted-foreground\">Connect the callbacks to Auth.js, Better Auth, Clerk or Supabase and rate-limit on the server; the component makes no network calls of its own.</p></li><li class=\"rounded-lg border border-black/5 dark:border-white/5 bg-neutral-50/80 dark:bg-neutral-900/95 backdrop-blur-xl backdrop-saturate-150 p-4 shadow-xs\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium tracking-tight\">Passwordless onboarding</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] leading-5 text-muted-foreground\">Set method=&quot;magic-link&quot; or &quot;otp&quot; and the same card walks through the email, code and check-inbox steps.</p></li><li class=\"rounded-lg border border-black/5 dark:border-white/5 bg-neutral-50/80 dark:bg-neutral-900/95 backdrop-blur-xl backdrop-saturate-150 p-4 shadow-xs\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium tracking-tight\">Marketing site with a split panel</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] leading-5 text-muted-foreground\">layout=&quot;split&quot; puts a quote or product shot beside the form from lg up and collapses to the card on phones.</p></li></ul></section></div><section id=\"related\" class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl scroll-mt-24 px-4 pb-16 sm:px-8 lg:px-16\" aria-labelledby=\"related-heading\"><div class=\"mb-5 flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4\"><h2 id=\"related-heading\" class=\"text-lg font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em]\">Related components</h2><a class=\"text-[13px] text-muted-foreground underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/components/logins\">All Logins components</a></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><a class=\"group relative flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-secondary/50 p-1 transition-colors hover:border-border hover:bg-secondary\" href=\"/components/portal-login\"><div class=\"aspect-video w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-muted\"><img src=\"/thumbs/portal-login.webp\" alt=\"Portal Login preview\" width=\"960\" height=\"557\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"size-full object-cover\"/></div><div class=\"px-1.5 pb-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><h3 class=\"min-w-0 truncate text-[13px] font-medium text-foreground p-1\">Portal Login</h3><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock size-3 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground/50\" aria-label=\"Pro\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" s